  description: '(This card is always treated as a "Phantom Beast" card.)

    Gains
    1000 ATK/DEF for each card in your hand. You can only use each of the following
    effects of "Candelato, the Beast of Light" once per turn. You can discard 2 other
    cards; Special Summon this card from your hand, then you can add 1 card from
    your Deck to your hand that has a coin tossing effect. When a card or effect
    is activated that includes an effect that adds a card(s) from the Deck to the
    hand (Quick Effect): You can negate that effect.'
